<title>UK: Lufthansa ups ex-UK Oct Tokyo, Seoul rates.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa ups ex-UK Oct Tokyo, Seoul rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa will raise ex-UK air cargo rates to Tokyo and Seoul from October 1, the carrier's UK cargo manager, Bob Bingley, told Reuters in a telephone interview.</p>
<p>Rates to the Japanese capital will increase by three percent and those to Seoul by five percent, he added.</p>
<p>Bingley also said that rates for the airline's &quot;Flash Express&quot; product to European markets were increased by an average of seven percent from September 1. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
